Caelza M4 phase 3a: Home and Procedures.

Home (/) is Caelza's: status before chat (Runtime, Mind and Body tiles),
what waits on the owner (procedure runs held at a gate, memory changes
awaiting review) and what happened while they were away (the Mind's digest
over the gateway's new /api/mind/digest, the Runtime's runs and sessions of
the last day). The upstream dashboard keeps its tabs at /dashboard and Home
forwards the old `/?tab=` deep links there. Procedures (/procedures) is the
front door to the SOP engine: waiting, running, the library, finished.

Mounts the digest route (crates/caelza-gateway/src/api_mind.rs, an overlay
file), wires the two pages (web/src/pages/Home.tsx, Procedures.tsx, overlay)
into the lazy page registry and the router, puts Home, Bodies, Memory and
Procedures in the sidebar's Home group with the dashboard under Operations,
mirrors that in the command palette, teaches the header and the tab title
the new sections, and adds the English nav.home / nav.procedures strings
(every other locale falls back to English). Applied after the rename, the
overlay and patches 0001 to 0004; regenerate with the same `diff -u` when
the upstream pin moves.

